<title>UK: DG Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>DG Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DG HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.25	MATURITY    14.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  99.87     PAY DATE    14.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES    **FOR YEAR ONE, 4.5 PCT YEAR TWO, 4.75 PCT YEAR THREE</p>
<p>		5.25 PCT YEAR FOUR, 6.0 PCT YEAR FIVE</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 765</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
